n adjuvant trial (11.7 against 8.1 months, hazard ratio 0.64, 0.52–0.80, P<0.001); and CapeOx on a 31-patient phase II trial in advanced small bowel and ampullary cancers of which 12 were ampullary, again not adjuvant. The full-text review confirms that BILCAP excluded ampullary carcinoma and that ABC-02 included the small, imprecise ampullary subgroup described above.",
